dnd-character-creation-class-tab = Class
dnd-character-creation-class-header = Class
dnd-character-creation-class-intro = Choose one class. NPC joins the round as a ghost and can take a ghost role once the round starts.
dnd-class-barbarian-name = Barbarian
dnd-class-barbarian-desc = Fights up close, driven by fury.
dnd-class-bard-name = Bard
dnd-class-bard-desc = Performs, inspires, and casts through art.
dnd-class-cleric-name = Cleric
dnd-class-cleric-desc = Wields divine magic in service of a faith.
dnd-class-druid-name = Druid
dnd-class-druid-desc = Draws magic from the natural world. Trained with simple weapons, light armor, shields, and an herbalism kit.
dnd-class-fighter-name = Fighter
dnd-class-fighter-desc = A trained master of weapons and armor.
dnd-class-monk-name = Monk
dnd-class-monk-desc = Strikes with a disciplined body and mind.
dnd-class-paladin-name = Paladin
dnd-class-paladin-desc = A sworn warrior charged with holy power.
dnd-class-ranger-name = Ranger
dnd-class-ranger-desc = A hunter skilled in the wilds.
dnd-class-rogue-name = Rogue
dnd-class-rogue-desc = Strikes from stealth and lives by skill.
dnd-class-sorcerer-name = Sorcerer
dnd-class-sorcerer-desc = Casts with magic born in the blood.
dnd-class-warlock-name = Warlock
dnd-class-warlock-desc = Casts with power bargained from a patron.
dnd-class-wizard-name = Wizard
dnd-class-wizard-desc = Studies spells and prepares them from a book.
dnd-class-npc-name = NPC
dnd-class-npc-desc = Join as a ghost and take a ghost role when the round starts.
