dnd-armor-medium = Medium armor
dnd-armor-heavy = Heavy armor
dnd-armor-shield = Shields
dnd-equipment-barbarian-gear = Greataxe, 4 handaxes, explorer's pack, and 15 GP
dnd-equipment-barbarian-gold = 75 GP
dnd-skill-animal-handling-name = Animal Handling
dnd-skill-animal-handling-desc = Calm, herd, or read an animal.
dnd-skill-athletics-name = Athletics
dnd-skill-athletics-desc = Climb, jump, and swim.
dnd-skill-intimidation-name = Intimidation
dnd-skill-intimidation-desc = Frighten or browbeat someone.
dnd-skill-nature-name = Nature
dnd-skill-nature-desc = Recall terrain, plants, and beasts.
dnd-skill-perception-name = Perception
dnd-skill-perception-desc = Notice a hidden creature or a quiet sound.
dnd-skill-survival-name = Survival
dnd-skill-survival-desc = Track, forage, and read the wilds.
dnd-feature-rage-name = Rage
dnd-feature-rage-desc = Enter a rage to resist weapon blows and hit harder with Strength. It lasts six seconds unless you attack or choose to keep it going, and it can be kept up for ten minutes. A short rest returns one use. A long rest returns all of them.
dnd-feature-unarmored-defense-name = Unarmored Defense
dnd-feature-unarmored-defense-desc = With no armor on, Armor Class is 10 plus your Dexterity and Constitution modifiers. A shield does not turn this off.
dnd-feature-weapon-mastery-name = Weapon Mastery
dnd-feature-weapon-mastery-desc = Choose two kinds of melee weapons and use their mastery properties. A long rest lets you change one choice.
