dnd-equipment-bard-gear = Leather armor, 2 daggers, a musical instrument, entertainer's pack, and 19 GP
dnd-equipment-bard-gold = 90 GP
dnd-skill-acrobatics-name = Acrobatics
dnd-skill-acrobatics-desc = Keep your footing and tumble past a blow.
dnd-skill-arcana-name = Arcana
dnd-skill-arcana-desc = Recall lore of spells, items, and planes.
dnd-skill-deception-name = Deception
dnd-skill-deception-desc = Hide the truth with a straight face.
dnd-skill-history-name = History
dnd-skill-history-desc = Recall kingdoms, wars, and old stories.
dnd-skill-insight-name = Insight
dnd-skill-insight-desc = Sense a lie or a mood.
dnd-skill-investigation-name = Investigation
dnd-skill-investigation-desc = Search a place and read the clues.
dnd-skill-medicine-name = Medicine
dnd-skill-medicine-desc = Tend a wound and spot an illness.
dnd-skill-performance-name = Performance
dnd-skill-performance-desc = Play, sing, or act for a crowd.
dnd-skill-persuasion-name = Persuasion
dnd-skill-persuasion-desc = Win someone over.
dnd-skill-religion-name = Religion
dnd-skill-religion-desc = Recall gods, rites, and holy symbols.
dnd-skill-sleight-of-hand-name = Sleight of Hand
dnd-skill-sleight-of-hand-desc = Palm an object or pick a pocket.
dnd-skill-stealth-name = Stealth
dnd-skill-stealth-desc = Hide and move quietly.
dnd-feature-bardic-inspiration-name = Bardic Inspiration
dnd-feature-bardic-inspiration-desc = As a bonus action, give a creature within 60 feet one inspiration die. It can add that die to a failed d20 test within the next hour. Uses equal your Charisma modifier, and at least one. A long rest returns them. The die is a d6.
dnd-feature-spellcasting-name = Spellcasting
dnd-feature-spellcasting-desc = You know 2 cantrips and prepare 4 level 1 spells from the bard list. Charisma is your spellcasting ability. A musical instrument can focus a spell. You have 2 spell slots, and a long rest returns them.
dnd-instrument-bagpipes = Bagpipes
dnd-instrument-drum = Drum
dnd-instrument-dulcimer = Dulcimer
dnd-instrument-flute = Flute
dnd-instrument-horn = Horn
dnd-instrument-lute = Lute
dnd-instrument-lyre = Lyre
dnd-instrument-pan-flute = Pan flute
dnd-instrument-shawm = Shawm
dnd-instrument-viol = Viol
dnd-spell-dancing-lights-name = Dancing Lights
dnd-spell-dancing-lights-desc = A mote of light appears for ten minutes.
dnd-spell-vicious-mockery-name = Vicious Mockery
dnd-spell-vicious-mockery-desc = Deal 1d6 psychic damage. Their next attack is hindered.
dnd-spell-starry-wisp-name = Starry Wisp
dnd-spell-starry-wisp-desc = A spell attack that deals 1d8 radiant damage.
dnd-spell-thunderclap-name = Thunderclap
dnd-spell-thunderclap-desc = Creatures within 5 feet take 1d6 thunder damage. Constitution save.
dnd-spell-light-name = Light
dnd-spell-light-desc = A light appears beside the target for ten minutes.
dnd-spell-charm-person-name = Charm Person
dnd-spell-charm-person-desc = Wisdom save, or the target joins your side for one hour.
dnd-spell-color-spray-name = Color Spray
dnd-spell-color-spray-desc = A cone of color blinds creatures for 6 seconds.
dnd-spell-dissonant-whispers-name = Dissonant Whispers
dnd-spell-dissonant-whispers-desc = 3d6 psychic damage. A failed Wisdom save sends them away from you.
dnd-spell-healing-word-name = Healing Word
dnd-spell-healing-word-desc = Bonus action. Heal 1d4 plus your spellcasting modifier.
dnd-spell-cure-wounds-name = Cure Wounds
dnd-spell-cure-wounds-desc = A touch heals 1d8 plus your spellcasting modifier.
dnd-spell-thunderwave-name = Thunderwave
dnd-spell-thunderwave-desc = 2d8 thunder in front of you. A failed Constitution save pushes them back.
dnd-spell-faerie-fire-name = Faerie Fire
dnd-spell-faerie-fire-desc = A failed Dexterity save outlines a creature. Attacks against it have advantage for one minute.
dnd-spell-bane-name = Bane
dnd-spell-bane-desc = A failed Charisma save hinders attacks and saves for one minute.
dnd-spell-heroism-name = Heroism
dnd-spell-heroism-desc = The target gains temporary hit points equal to your Charisma modifier for one minute.
dnd-spell-sleep-name = Sleep
dnd-spell-sleep-desc = The weakest creatures nearby fall unconscious for one minute.
dnd-spell-longstrider-name = Longstrider
dnd-spell-longstrider-desc = The target's pace rises by 10 feet for one hour.
dnd-class-divine-order = Divine Order
dnd-divine-order-protector = Protector. Martial weapons and heavy armor.
dnd-divine-order-thaumaturge = Thaumaturge. One extra cantrip, and a bonus on Arcana and Religion checks.
dnd-equipment-cleric-gear = Chain shirt, shield, mace, holy symbol, priest's pack, and 7 GP
dnd-equipment-cleric-gold = 110 GP
dnd-feature-cleric-spellcasting-name = Spellcasting
dnd-feature-cleric-spellcasting-desc = You know 3 cantrips and prepare 4 level 1 cleric spells. Wisdom is your spellcasting ability. A holy symbol focuses a spell that needs one. You have 2 spell slots. A long rest returns them, and for a minute afterward you can change the prepared list.
dnd-feature-divine-order-name = Divine Order
dnd-feature-divine-order-desc = Protector trains you with martial weapons and heavy armor. Thaumaturge grants one extra cantrip and a bonus to Arcana and Religion checks equal to your Wisdom modifier, at least +1.
dnd-spell-guidance-name = Guidance
dnd-spell-guidance-desc = The next attack or saving throw within one minute adds 1d4.
dnd-spell-sacred-flame-name = Sacred Flame
dnd-spell-sacred-flame-desc = 1d8 radiant damage. Dexterity save.
dnd-spell-thaumaturgy-name = Thaumaturgy
dnd-spell-thaumaturgy-desc = A minor wonder. A mote of light appears for ten minutes.
dnd-spell-mending-name = Mending
dnd-spell-mending-desc = Repair one break in an object you touch.
dnd-spell-resistance-name = Resistance
dnd-spell-resistance-desc = The target resists bludgeoning, piercing, and slashing for one minute.
dnd-spell-spare-name = Spare the Dying
dnd-spell-spare-desc = A dying creature stabilizes with 1 hit point.
dnd-spell-bless-name = Bless
dnd-spell-bless-desc = Up to three allies add 1d4 to attack rolls and saving throws for one minute.
dnd-spell-command-name = Command
dnd-spell-command-desc = A failed Wisdom save drops the target to the ground.
dnd-spell-guiding-bolt-name = Guiding Bolt
dnd-spell-guiding-bolt-desc = A spell attack for 4d6 radiant. The next attack against them has advantage.
dnd-spell-shield-of-faith-name = Shield of Faith
dnd-spell-shield-of-faith-desc = Bonus action. +2 Armor Class for one minute.
dnd-spell-inflict-wounds-name = Inflict Wounds
dnd-spell-inflict-wounds-desc = A touch spell attack for 3d10 necrotic damage.
dnd-spell-sanctuary-name = Sanctuary
dnd-spell-sanctuary-desc = An attacker must pass a Wisdom save or lose the attack. It ends if the warded creature attacks.
dnd-spell-protection-name = Protection from Evil and Good
dnd-spell-protection-desc = Attacks from another side have disadvantage for one minute.
dnd-spell-water-name = Create or Destroy Water
dnd-spell-water-desc = A splash of water soaks the target and slows them.
dnd-spell-purify-name = Purify Food and Drink
dnd-spell-purify-desc = Food and drink you touch are made safe.
dnd-spell-detect-evil-name = Detect Evil and Good
dnd-spell-detect-evil-desc = You learn the side of each creature within 30 feet.
dnd-spell-detect-magic-name = Detect Magic
dnd-spell-detect-magic-desc = You notice magical creatures within 30 feet.
dnd-spell-detect-poison-name = Detect Poison and Disease
dnd-spell-detect-poison-desc = You learn whether the target carries poison.
dnd-equipment-druid-gear = Leather armor, shield, sickle, druidic focus, explorer's pack, herbalism kit, and 9 GP
dnd-equipment-druid-gold = 50 GP
dnd-feature-druid-spellcasting-name = Spellcasting
dnd-feature-druid-spellcasting-desc = You know 2 cantrips and prepare 4 level 1 druid spells. Wisdom is your spellcasting ability. A druidic focus focuses a spell that needs one. You have 2 spell slots. A long rest returns them, and for a minute afterward you can change the prepared list. Speak with Animals is always prepared and does not count against the four.
dnd-feature-druidic-name = Druidic
dnd-feature-druidic-desc = You know Druidic. Speak with Animals is always prepared. Right-click yourself to leave a hidden sign. Another druid reads it. Anyone else notices the mark with a DC 15 Intelligence (Investigation) check and cannot read it.
dnd-feature-primal-order-name = Primal Order
dnd-feature-primal-order-desc = Magician grants one extra cantrip and a bonus to Arcana and Nature checks equal to your Wisdom modifier, at least +1. Warden trains you with martial weapons and medium armor.
dnd-class-primal-order = Primal Order
dnd-primal-order-magician = Magician
dnd-primal-order-warden = Warden
dnd-class-always-prepared = Always prepared: { $spells }
dnd-spell-druidcraft-name = Druidcraft
dnd-spell-druidcraft-desc = A brief wonder of nature. A mote of light appears for ten minutes.
dnd-spell-elementalism-name = Elementalism
dnd-spell-elementalism-desc = A gust shoves a creature 5 feet.
dnd-spell-message-name = Message
dnd-spell-message-desc = Whisper a short message to a creature within 120 feet.
dnd-spell-poison-spray-name = Poison Spray
dnd-spell-poison-spray-desc = 1d12 poison damage. Constitution save.
dnd-spell-produce-flame-name = Produce Flame
dnd-spell-produce-flame-desc = A spell attack for 1d8 fire. A flame stays in your hand for ten minutes.
dnd-spell-shillelagh-name = Shillelagh
dnd-spell-shillelagh-desc = Bonus action. A club or quarterstaff you hold uses Wisdom, and its damage die becomes at least a d8, for one minute.
dnd-spell-animal-friendship-name = Animal Friendship
dnd-spell-animal-friendship-desc = A beast that fails a Wisdom save is calmed for one hour.
dnd-spell-entangle-name = Entangle
dnd-spell-entangle-desc = Creatures in 20 feet that fail a Strength save fall and are tangled.
dnd-spell-fog-name = Fog Cloud
dnd-spell-fog-desc = Creatures in 20 feet are blinded for a moment.
dnd-spell-goodberry-name = Goodberry
dnd-spell-goodberry-desc = Ten berries appear. Eating one restores 1 hit point.
dnd-spell-ice-knife-name = Ice Knife
dnd-spell-ice-knife-desc = A spell attack for 1d10 piercing, then 2d6 cold to creatures within 5 feet. Constitution save for half the cold.
dnd-spell-jump-name = Jump
dnd-spell-jump-desc = The target leaps 15 feet.
dnd-spell-speak-animals-name = Speak with Animals
dnd-spell-speak-animals-desc = For ten minutes, examining a beast tells you what it understands.

